80","kind":"announcement","title":"Rain Of Lead Livestream on Steam Next Fest Launch Day!!","summary":"Hi players!Today is the first day of Steam Next Fest, and our developers will start a livestream this afternoon!You are welcome to bring any questions and feedback to the devs during the stream!We will openly answer your questions regarding Yuri elements, storyline and art design. Just keep your queries within content guidelines, haha.The Rain Of Lead demo is now available for download on the demo page!We have a huge request: please add Rain Of Lead to your Steam wishlist!!!Thank you all so much","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:37:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693686","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801980-1846651706693490","game_id":"steam-4801980","kind":"announcement","title":"Yuri × One-Hit Kill! 2D Side-Scroller Rain Of Lead is in Steam Next Fest October","summary":"Rain Of Lead is a dieselpunk 2D pixel side-scrolling action game inspired by Katana ZERO. Every strike is lethal. No margin for mistake. Both the player and all enemies die from a single hit. Alternate between sword and pistol on the fly, weave through artillery barrages, slay infantry, cannons and tanks, confront a full army and experience visceral high-speed slaughter.Steam Next Fest October Demo is LIVE! Add to your wishlist to join our giveaway!Game SynopsisBranching choices of the heartYour","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T02:50:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693490","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4801980-1844115010498397","game_id":"steam-4801980","kind":"announcement","title":"Indie game Rain of Lead demo is out! Experience the aesthetic of one-hit kills!","summary":"The demo page for Rain of Lead is live, and the demo build is now available for download! We will also take part in Steam Next Fest this October — please add the game to your wishlist!Steam Demo Page:\\:https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1J3ev6HE4E/?share_source=copy_web&vd_source=bd39c6b41965738c810600b2f8e9cb41Rain of Lead is a diesel‑punk 2D pixel‑art side‑scrolling action title inspired by Katana ZERO. Combat offers zero margin for error: both player and enemies die from a single hit. Swap seam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T06:14:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498397","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:25:13Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4801980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:07Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:07Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4801980":"2026-10-26T04:25:07Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4801980":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5086270":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:07Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:25:07Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4801980","app_id":4801980,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:58Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1538779128f66048d082518e6f487398db40c7efb10fd2ebd3932ab7200b24af","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"모든 공격이 치명적이며, 실수는 용납되지 않습니다. 검과 권총을 번갈아 사용해 병사, 포병, 전차를 돌파하고 군대 전체를 무너